00:12:01.943 --> 00:12:05.003
Because a cog or a dat,
neither one of those is,

00:12:06.345 --> 00:12:07.353
it's not a good name.

00:12:07.353 --> 00:12:08.580
It's not like a liger.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.809
- [Rhett] Yeah, it's got.

00:12:09.809 --> 00:12:10.642
- Like, oh, they gotta mate

00:12:10.642 --> 00:12:12.040
