we put visual aids on all that stuff.

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:36.040
So my main concern was them meeting,

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.930
and I read up about this.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.300
Okay, you're supposed to put the cat in-

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.170
- Butts first, butt to butt.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:45.340
