in a little carrier,

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.480
put the kitten in there in Lily's room.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:52.210
And then close the door,
don't let Jade in the room.

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:56.070
And let the cat out of the
crate, and for a few days,

00:13:56.070 --> 00:14:00.190
maybe a week, get used
to just that one space,

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.498
Lily's room where he does his business,

00:14:03.498 --> 00:14:06.350
not in her closet, we
didn't put the litter box

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:08.890
